    "statements": [
      "The w32tm command runs from a Command Prompt opened as administrator. w32tm /resync tells the computer to resynchronize its clock as soon as possible, and /rediscover redetects network sources first.",
      "Windows time synchronization uses UDP port 123, and non-domain-joined computers default to the time.windows.com server."
